    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t01-mother-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t01-mother-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26北京）一辆车从甲地出发在甲、乙两地之间不间断匀速往返，前3次到达两地之间的丙地时间分别为8：00、8：40和9：50。则这辆车是几点出发的？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "7:25"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "7:30"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "7: 35"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "7:40"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          64
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          58
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s06-t01-mother-01-p064.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（一） · 母题精讲1 · 讲义第58页",
            "pdfPage": 64
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t01-mother-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s06-t01-mother-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先画经过顺序：甲→丙→乙→丙→甲→丙。8点到8点40走的是丙到乙再回丙，共40分钟，所以丙到乙单程20分钟。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "8点40到9点50走的是丙到甲再回丙，共70分钟，所以甲到丙单程35分钟。第一次8点到丙，出发时间就是7点25分，选A。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "连续经过中间点的间隔要先还原为哪一侧的往返。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
