    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t01-mother-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t01-mother-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26国考）小王从甲地匀速前往乙地，到达后立刻匀速返回。已知他去程的用时比返程多3小时，去程的速度是返程的40%，且往返的平均速度为40千米／小时，问甲、乙两地相距多少千米？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "70"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "140"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "210"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "280"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          64
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          58
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s06-t01-mother-02-p064.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（一） · 母题精讲2 · 讲义第58页",
            "pdfPage": 64
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t01-mother-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s06-t01-mother-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们看去返同路程，去速是返速的40%，所以去程时间是返程的2.5倍。设返程t小时，则2.5t－t＝3，得返程2小时、去程5小时。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "全程共7小时，平均速度40千米/小时，总路程280千米，单程140千米，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "等路程用时间反比，再由往返总时间和平均速度求单程。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
